<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy — TotalRecalls" description="TotalRecalls is local-only. We never host your chats." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Privacy" }]}>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Your conversations belong to you.</strong></p>
  <p>TotalRecalls does not collect, store, or transmit your AI chats, session tokens, or download data. Everything stays on your PC.</p>

  <h2>What TotalRecalls does not store</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your chats</li>
    <li>Your session tokens</li>
    <li>Your passwords</li>
    <li>Your downloaded conversations</li>
    <li>Analytics or telemetry</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Local-only design</h2>
  <p>TotalRecalls runs locally. Sign-in happens inside a small embedded browser window on your machine. We never see your credentials.</p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Lemon Squeezy</strong> — handles payments. Operates independently.</li>
    <li><strong>Microsoft WebView2</strong> — powers embedded sign-in windows. Operates independently.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>privacy@totalrecalls.app</p>
</PageLayout>
